*.pyc

# Web interface run directories: patient details, generated reports and run
# logs. Never commit these -- this repository is code, not clinical data.
webapp_runs/
webapp/webapp_runs/

# Written by `install_pipeline.py --update` when this checkout IS the
# installation being updated: the previous copy of every replaced file.
# Useful to keep on disk, never something to commit.
.bundle-backup-*/

# Orchestrator logs, written beside wherever it was run from.
pipeline_logs/

